# Changelog

## 1.0.3 (October 2026)

- Fixed: the opening message was never sent to WhatsApp.
- Fixed: the default message was saved as a raw language key. Existing modules are cleaned up on update.
- Fixed: a link could be built from only a country code or only a number.
- Fixed: setting descriptions were missing (mismatched language keys).
- Updates now come from kindofuseful.com through the Joomla updater (the old update address no longer works).
- Requires Joomla 5.0+ and PHP 8.1+.

## 1.0.2 (July 2025)

- Released online; updated namespace.

## 1.0.1

- First release.
